        "x": 632,
        "y": 303
      },
      "action": null,
      "lines": [
        "Use 1\u20139 once in each row, column and 3\u00d73 box. The",
        "shaded cross follows your selection; a bracketed",
        "number or small square marks your target. Given",
        "numbers cannot change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 443,
      "width": 1170,
      "height": 256,
      "centre": {
        "x": 632,
        "y": 571
      },
      "action": null,
      "lines": [
        "Tap Notes, then numbers to add or remove notes. A",
        "dot marks a square with notes; its selected numbers",
        "have outlined keys. Tap Digits to enter answers.",
        "Erase a filled square before adding notes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 711,
      "width": 1170,
      "height": 256,
      "centre": {
        "x": 632,
        "y": 839
      },
      "action": null,
      "lines": [
        "More offers erase, checking and reveal. Checking",
        "starts off. Turn it on to flag a wrong selected answer",
        "without rejecting your entry. Revealing a square",
        "asks first and counts as a hint."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 979,
      "width": 1170,
      "height": 256,
      "centre": {
        "x": 632,
        "y": 1107
      },
      "action": null,
      "lines": [
        "Your game saves after every edit. Undo restores the",
        "last 64 moves, even after reopening. A full correct",
        "grid completes the puzzle. New puzzle replaces the",
        "current game and its history."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 1247,
      "width": 1170,
      "height": 128,
      "centre": {
        "x": 632,
        "y": 1311
      },
      "action": null,
      "lines": [
        "Landscape shows the whole board with the digits",
        "beside it."
      ]
